  <title>1.2.4: Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00078</md:content-id>
    <md:title>1.2.4: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>e4721959-884b-4f9c-ac0b-349e6f6410bb</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
    <section>
      <para dir="ltr">Sweet’s Candy Store charges $5.00 to fill a bag of candy. There is also a
        sales tax of 7% per purchase. Mrs. Smith buys 4 bags of candy for her children for
        Christmas. What is an equation that can represent the cost of the candy that Mrs. Smith
        buys? </para>
    </section>
  </content>
</document>